{"type": "standard", "title": "Udawalawe National Park", "displaytitle": "<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Udawalawe National Park</span></span>", "namespace": {"id": 0, "text": ""}, "wikibase_item": "Q131875", "titles": {"canonical": "Udawalawe_National_Park", "normalized": "Udawalawe National Park", "display": "<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Udawalawe National Park</span></span>"}, "pageid": 579524, "thumbnail": {"source": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Udawalawe_National_Park_%28Udawalawa_Reservoir%29.jpg/330px-Udawalawe_National_Park_%28Udawalawa_Reservoir%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail", "width": 330, "height": 143}, "originalimage": {"source": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Udawalawe_National_Park_%28Udawalawa_Reservoir%29.jpg/3840px-Udawalawe_National_Park_%28Udawalawa_Reservoir%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail", "width": 4544, "height": 1964}, "lang": "en", "dir": "ltr", "revision": "1376093320", "tid": "8fed4c8e-b623-11f1-85d8-4576b46822c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T01:18:48Z", "description": "National park in Sri Lanka", "description_source": "local", "coordinates": {"lat": 6.43833333, "lon": 80.88833333}, "content_urls": {"desktop": {"page": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udawalawe_National_Park", "revisions": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udawalawe_National_Park?action=history", "edit": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udawalawe_National_Park?action=edit", "talk": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Udawalawe_National_Park"}, "mobile": {"page": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udawalawe_National_Park", "revisions": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Udawalawe_National_Park", "edit": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udawalawe_National_Park?action=edit", "talk": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Udawalawe_National_Park"}}, "extract": "Udawalawe National Park is a national park on the boundary of Uva and Sabaragamuwa Provinces in Sri Lanka. The park was created to provide a sanctuary for wild animals displaced by the construction of the Udawalawe Reservoir on the Walawe River, as well as to protect the catchment of the reservoir. The reserve covers 30,821 hectares (119.00\u00a0mi2) of land area and was established on 30 June 1972.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Udawalawe National Park</b> is a national park on the boundary of Uva and Sabaragamuwa Provinces in Sri Lanka. The park was created to provide a sanctuary for wild animals displaced by the construction of the Udawalawe Reservoir on the Walawe River, as well as to protect the catchment of the reservoir. The reserve covers 30,821 hectares (119.00\u00a0mi<sup>2</sup>) of land area and was established on 30 June 1972.</p>"}